{"speciesId":354,"names":{"fr":"Branette","es":"Banette","en":"Banette","ja":"ジュペッタ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"BANETTE generates energy for laying strong curses by sticking pins into its own body. This POKéMON was originally a pitiful plush doll that was thrown away."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"A cursed energy permeated the stuffing of a discarded and forgotten plush doll, giving it new life as BANETTE. The POKéMON’s energy would escape if it were to ever open its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"An abandoned plush doll became this POKéMON. They are said to live in garbage dumps and wander about in search of the children that threw them away."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Strong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a POKéMON. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Strong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a POKéMON. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"This Pokémon developed from an abandoned doll that amassed a grudge. It is seen in dark alleys."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"This Pokémon developed from an abandoned doll that amassed a grudge. It is seen in dark alleys."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Une poupée mue par la tristesse qui la ronge depuis qu’on l’a délaissée. Elle recherche son propriétaire."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Une poupée mue par la tristesse qui la ronge depuis qu’on l’a délaissée. Elle recherche son propriétaire."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge of being thrown away. It seeks the child who disowned it."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge of being thrown away. It seeks the child who disowned it."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Une poupée mue par la tristesse qui la ronge depuis qu’on l’a délaissée. Elle recherche son propriétaire."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Este muñeco se convirtió en un Pokémon cuando lo tiraron a la basura. Busca a su antiguo dueño."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A doll that became a Pokémon over its grudge from being junked. It seeks the child that disowned it."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"捨てられた ぬいぐるみに おんねんが 宿り ポケモンになった。自分を 捨てた 子供を 捜している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un très violent sentiment de haine a transformé une poupée de chiffon en Branette. S’il ouvre la bouche, une énergie négative s’en échappe."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando abandonaron a este muñeco de felpa, se convirtió en Pokémon. Libera una energía que hechiza al enemigo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Strong feelings of hatred turned a puppet into a Pokémon. If it opens its mouth, its cursed energy escapes."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"強い おん念が ぬいぐるみを ポケモンに 変えた。口を 開けると のろいの エネルギーが 逃げていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"En plantant des aiguilles dans son propre corps, Branette génère de l’énergie permettant de lancer de puissantes malédictions. Au départ, ce Pokémon n’était qu’une malheureuse peluche jetée à la poubelle."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Banette genera energía para echar un infalible hechizo clavándose púas a sí mismo. Los orígenes de este Pokémon son algo tristes: era un muñeco de felpa al que tiraron a la basura."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Banette generates energy for laying strong curses by sticking pins into its own body. This Pokémon was originally a pitiful plush doll that was thrown away."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"自分の 体を 針で キズつける とき 強い のろいの エネルギーが 発生する。 元は 捨てられた 可哀想な ぬいぐるみ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Une énergie maudite a pénétré le rembourrage d’une vieille peluche abandonnée, donnant ainsi vie à Branette. L’énergie de ce Pokémon s’échappe s’il ouvre la bouche."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Fue un hechizo el que hizo que el relleno de este muñeco de felpa olvidado y abandonado pasara a ser Banette. Si este Pokémon abriera la boca, se quedaría sin energía."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A cursed energy permeated the stuffing of a discarded and forgotten plush doll, giving it new life as Banette. The Pokémon’s energy would escape if it were to ever open its mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"捨てられた ぬいぐるみの 綿に のろいの エネルギーが 染み込んで ポケモンに なった。 口を 開けると エネルギーが 逃げてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Animée par la rancune, cette poupée abandonnée traque son ancien propriétaire pour se venger."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este muñeco de trapo alberga gran odio por la persona que lo abandonó, a quien busca sin descanso para vengarse."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s a stuffed toy that was thrown away and became possessed, ever searching for the one who threw it away so it can exact its revenge."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"捨てられた ヌイグルミに 怨念が 宿った。 自分を 捨てた者を 探し 復しゅうする つもりだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il est né de la rancune qu’il a ressentie quand il a été abandonné. Il redevient apparemment une poupée si l’on en prend grand soin."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El rencor de haber sido tirado a la basura fue lo que le dio vida. Se dice que puede convertirse de nuevo en muñeco si se le trata con cariño."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Resentment at being cast off made it spring into being. Some say that treating it well will satisfy it, and it will once more become a stuffed toy."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"捨てられた 怨念で 生まれる。 大切に されると 満足して 元の ヌイグルミに 戻るという。"}],"varieties":[{"id":354,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"disable","learns":[[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"mac